Adaptation_method:
Change event-style property assignments to method invocations.
Before:
q.drain = function() { ... }
q.saturated = function() { ... }
q.empty = fn;
q.error = fn;
q.unsaturated = fn;
After:
q.drain(function() { ... })
q.saturated(function() { ... })
q.empty(fn)
q.error(fn)
q.unsaturated(fn)
To await the event:
await q.drain()
await q.empty()
